=== obj-nextsame-if-where-candidate
from: PDF 0.6.15 lib/PDF/IO/Crypt/AST.rakumod:50
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: call nextsame
--- code
my class Crypt {
    has Bool $.EncryptMetadata = False;
    multi method crypt-ast('stream', Hash $ast where .<dict> eq 'Metadata') {
        say 'metadata stream';
        nextsame if $.EncryptMetadata;
    }
    multi method crypt-ast('stream', Hash $ast, |c) {
        say "encrypting {$ast<dict>}";
    }
}
Crypt.new.crypt-ast('stream', { dict => 'Metadata' });
Crypt.new(:EncryptMetadata).crypt-ast('stream', { dict => 'Metadata' });
Crypt.new.crypt-ast('stream', { dict => 'Page' });
--- expect
metadata stream
metadata stream
encrypting Metadata
encrypting Page

=== obj-nextwith-new-default-named
